.SS Function Composition
\f[B](comp f g)\f[R]
.PP
Right to left function composition.
.PP
\f[B](comp fs x)\f[R]
.PP
Compose a list of functions \f[CR]fs\f[R], right to left, and apply the
resulting function to \f[CR]x\f[R].
.PP
